cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in research or teaching, please cite it using this file."
title: "SurgicalAir: A Touchless 21-Point Hand Interface"
abstract: >-
  SurgicalAir is a research prototype that turns an ordinary webcam into a
  real-time hand sensor. It extracts 21 landmarks, derives pinch, openness, and
  rotation signals, and uses them to control a browser-based 3D laboratory, a
  precision game, and prototype hardware. It is not a medical device and has
  no clinical validation.
